-by-step plan","slug":"how-to-implement-a-crm","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Here's how to implement a CRM the way teams that actually adopt it do — a step-by-step plan covering goals, data migration, integrations, rollout, and the mistakes that sink most projects.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/crm-implement-sales-planning.webp","imageAlt":"Latino sales team in a planning meeting, illustrating how to implement a CRM system step by step"},{"title":"Salesforce vs HubSpot vs Zoho: which CRM fits?","slug":"salesforce-vs-hubspot-vs-zoho","category":"Guide","excerpt":"A vendor-neutral Salesforce vs HubSpot CRM comparison — plus Zoho. Match each platform to team size, budget, and sales complexity so you pick the CRM your reps will actually use, not the one with the loudest brand.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/crm-salesforce-vs-logos.webp","imageAlt":"Salesforce vs HubSpot vs Zoho logos, comparing the leading CRM platforms"},{"title":"Why CRM implementations fail (and the adoption fix)","slug":"why-crm-implementations-fail","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Most CRM implementation failure traces back to one cause: the team won't use the system. Here's why CRM projects fail, the warning signs, and the adoption-first fix that makes a CRM stick.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/why-crm-fails-disengaged.webp","imageAlt":"A frustrated sales manager facing a declining dashboard, illustrating why CRM implementations fail"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
